{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20299","headline":"楚宫行 · 张籍","name":"楚宫行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"章华宫中九月时，桂花半落红橘垂。\n江头骑火照辇道，君王夜从云梦归。\n霓旌凤盖到双阙，台上重重歌吹发。\n千门万户开相当，烛笼左右列成行。\n下辇更衣入洞房，洞房侍女尽焚香。\n玉阶罗幕微有霜，齐言此夕乐未央。\n玉酒湛湛盈华觞，丝竹次第鸣中堂。\n巴姬起舞向君王，回身垂手结明璫。\n愿君千年万年寿，朝出射麋夜饮酒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20299.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20299","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}